# Build with: RUSTFLAGS="-C target-feature=+crt-static" and target=x86_64-unknown-linux-musl for static binary (musl).
# Capabilities: needs CAP_SYS_ADMIN (mount, swapon), CAP_SYS_BOOT (optional), CAP_NET_ADMIN (optional for interface up if you do it directly).
# Running as PID 1 bypasses many capability checks if started by kernel as init.

